PB 1.2.vistaprint_album/
Company profile UI redesign.zip
Screenshot *.png
# Stray working copies at the repo root, NOT the real asset in public/.
# These patterns must stay anchored with a leading slash: unanchored, a
# gitignore-style pattern matches at every depth, so plain
# `birdsong_logo_mark_v2.svg` also stripped public/birdsong_logo_mark_v2.svg
# from every deploy. That is the sidebar account avatar, so it 404'd in
# production and rendered as a broken-image glyph while working fine locally.
/birdsong_logo_mark_v2 copy.svg
/birdsong_logo_mark_v2.svg
# The 173KB PNG beside it is genuinely unused — only the SVG is referenced.
public/birdsong_logo_mark_v2.png

# Never upload local secrets. .gitignore already excludes these, but a
# .vercelignore entry is explicit and doesn't depend on that continuing to
# be true — belt and suspenders after NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL's stale local
# value (and this file's real API keys) turned up baked into a production
# build.
.env
.env.local
.env*.local
